1- index the codebase:
read files and chunk them
then presist an index that retrieval can query in miliseconds
--> indexing must take at most 5 minutes

python files and markdown files do not break in the same manner!
python code chunking
markdown / text chunking

for retrieval use at least one of the two lexical methods:
tf-idf
bm25
