==> 2000 is also the maximum, moulinette wont accept it!

2- retrieval:
now that we havet he index built, we need to retrieve it
your system returns top-k most relevant snippet
each result is a source location:
    file_path/the_character_range

questions exists in json file!
your system must at least reach:
    80% on doc questions
    50% on code questions
    --> this is defined in evaluation chapter!



